  "id": "stream-of-consciousness",
  "term": "stream of consciousness",
  "definition": "Stream of consciousness refers to the spontaneous ongoing flow of thoughts that occurs while a person is awake but not occupied by a demanding task. In contemporary psychology, this idea is commonly discussed as mind-wandering.",
